on 2026 - Mumbai Meghwal Panchayat & Vidya Gohil Trust**\\n\\n• **Event**: Annual Student Education Felicitation 2026\\n• **Eligibility**: Students scoring 50%+ in 10th, 12th, Degree, Diploma & Post-Graduation\\n• **Registration Portal**: Online via website Events section\\n• **Venue & Date**: Mumbai (To be officially announced soon)\\n• **Required Documents**: Marksheet & Passport Photo\\n\\nFor assistance with registration, contact your Vibhag Head.","enabled":true,"roleAccess":"public","adminOnly":false,"attachedWhatsAppTplId":"","attachedFormId":"","storageDestination":"donations"},{"id":"kb_pending","order":3,"cmd":"/edu_pending","icon":"⏳","title":"Pending Review Registrations","answer":"⏳ **Pending Applications**:\\n\\nList of student registrations currently awaiting committee document verification.","enabled":true,"roleAccess":"vibhag_admin","adminOnly":true,"attachedWhatsAppTplId":"","attachedFormId":"","storageDestination":"donations"},{"id":"kb_approved","order":4,"cmd":"/edu_approved","icon":"🟢","title":"Approved Registrations List","answer":"🟢 **Approved Applications**:\\n\\nList of verified and confirmed student applicants.","enabled":true,"roleAccess":"vibhag_admin","adminOnly":true,"attachedWhatsAppTplId":"","attachedFormId":"","storageDestination":"donations"},{"id":"kb_check","order":5,"cmd":"/edu_check","icon":"🔍","title":"Check Application Status","answer":"🔍 **Check Application Status**:\\n\\nPlease enter your **Transaction ID (e.g. VG-7, EDU26-2)** or **Registered Mobile Number** to look up your live status.","enabled":true,"roleAccess":"public","adminOnly":false,"attachedWhatsAppTplId":"","attachedFormId":"","storageDestination":"donations"},{"id":"kb_vibhag","order":6,"cmd":"/edu_vibhag","icon":"📍","title":"Summary by Vibhag #","answer":"📍 **Vibhag-wise Analytics**:\\n\\nSelect or enter a specific Vibhag (e.g. 10 MAHALAXMI, 15 RAMDEV NAGAR) to see localized registration data.","enabled":true,"roleAccess":"vibhag_admin","adminOnly":true,"attachedWhatsAppTplId":"","attachedFormId":"","storageDestination":"donations"},{"id":"kb_donationsummary","order":7,"cmd":"/don_summary","icon":"📊","title":"Donation Summary (Vibhag-wise Collections)","answer":"📊 **Donation Summary Dashboard**: Real-time breakdown of total collections, online Razorpay vs offline cash/cheque splits, and Vibhag-by-Vibhag financial metrics.","enabled":true,"roleAccess":"donation_collector","adminOnly":true,"attachedWhatsAppTplId":"tpl_edu_appeal","attachedFormId":"","storageDestination":"donations"},{"id":"kb_donerlist","order":8,"cmd":"/don_list","icon":"📋","title":"Donor Registry List & WhatsApp Broadcast","answer":"📋 **Person-wise Donor Registry**: Numbered list of individual donors, amounts, Vibhags, receipt numbers, and 1-click WhatsApp broadcast generator.","enabled":true,"roleAccess":"donation_collector","adminOnly":true,"attachedWhatsAppTplId":"tpl_edu_appeal","attachedFormId":"","storageDestination":"donations"},{"id":"kb_donation_update","order":9,"cmd":"/don_entry","icon":"✍️","title":"Record Offline Donation","answer":"✍️ **Record Offline Donation**:\\n\\nUse the interactive form below to record cash, cheque, or direct bank transfer donations with instant database syncing.","enabled":true,"roleAccess":"donation_collector","adminOnly":true,"attachedFormId":"form_1786378063213","storageDestination":"donations","attachedWhatsAppTplId":""},{"id":"kb_donate","order":10,"cmd":"/don_80g","icon":"💰","title":"80G Tax Donations & Bank Details","answer":"💰 **Donations & 80G Tax Exemption**:\\n\\n• Vidya Gohil Charitable Trust offers **80G Tax Benefits** for all eligible donations under Indian Income Tax regulations.\\n• You can donate online securely via Razorpay (UPI, Google Pay, PhonePe, Cards, NetBanking) on our **Donate** page.\\n• Automated 80G tax receipts and 10BE acknowledgement certificates are provided.","enabled":false,"roleAccess":"public","adminOnly":false,"attachedWhatsAppTplId":"tpl_general_donation","attachedFormId":"","storageDestination":"donations"},{"id":"kb_cwc_committee","order":11,"cmd":"/cwc_committee","icon":"🏛️","title":"CWC Committee Members","answer":"🏛️ **Central Working Committee (CWC) Members**:\\n\\nRavi Dharia -\\tPresident MMP CWC and Trustee\\nVinod Makawana\\t- Trustee & General Secretary / MahaMantri\\nPrakash Gohil\\t- Trustee and Treasurer\\nVasant Padaya\\t- Trustee & Vice President\\nBhavanabe Koli\\t- Trustee & Vice President\\nPremjibai Kundhadiya\\t- Trustee & Vice President\\nRanjanben V. Maru\\t- Trustee & Mantri\\nVijaybhai Dodhiya\\t- Trustee & Mantri\\nDevjibhai\\t- Trustee & Mantri\\nDevjibhai\\t- Trustee & Mantri\\n","enabled":true,"roleAccess":"public","adminOnly":false},{"cmd":"/edu_committee","icon":"❓","title":"Education Committee member 2026","answer":"Education Committee 2026\\n1)  Vinod J. Makwana - President \\n2) Pradeep K. Parmar - Chairman \\n3) Harish K. Makwana - Gen.Secretary\\n4) Bharat R. Solanki - Treasurer\\n5) Jitendra L. Koli - Vice Chairman \\n6) Deepak H. Singrakhia - Vice Chairman\\n7) Urmilaben H. Baria - Vice Chairman \\n8) Hansaben D. Sandis - Vice Chairman \\n9) Laxmiben D. Anjara - Secretary \\n10) Nikhil S. Velari - Secretary \\n11) Paresh B. Mahida - Secretary\\n12) Minesh C. Rathod - Secretary","enabled":true,"adminOnly":false,"id":"kb_1787305349524","roleAccess":"public","attachedWhatsAppTplId":"","attachedFormId":"","storageDestination":"donations","order":12},{"id":"kb_contact","order":13,"cmd":"/contact","icon":"📞","title":"Trust Helpline & Office Contacts","answer":"📞 **Trust Office & Helpline Contacts**:\\n\\n• **Office**: Mumbai, Maharashtra\\n• **Email**: info@mmp-cwc-new.com\\n• **Helpline Mobile**: +91 9820785209 / +91 9967821964\\n• **Timings**: 10:00 AM – 7:00 PM (Mon – Sat)","enabled":true,"roleAccess":"public","adminOnly":false},{"cmd":"/edu_eligibility","icon":"❓","title":"Eligibility of 2026","answer":"In  Education Felicitation 2026\\nWho is Eligible?\\n1. Students & Higher Education\\nStudents who have successfully cleared their latest and final examination of their respective course/stream in 2026 are eligible for the felicitation award, including:\\n•\\tSSC\\n•\\tHSC\\n•\\t Graduate Degrees\\n•\\tPost-Graduate Degrees\\n•\\tProfessional & Higher Education\\n•\\tAny other recognized course where the final year/final examination was successfully completed in 2026\\n2. Learning & Skill Development – Age 30+\\nIndividuals aged 30 years or above who have completed any educational, professional, or skill-development course are also eligible to participate.\\nExamples include:\\n•\\tComputer Courses\\n•\\tEnglish Speaking Courses\\n•\\tForeign / Indian Language Learning Courses\\n•\\tProfessional Skill Courses\\n•\\tVocational Training\\n•\\tTechnical Courses\\n•\\tOther recognized educational or skill-development programs","enabled":true,"adminOnly":false,"id":"kb_1787307584031","roleAccess":"public","attachedWhatsAppTplId":"","attachedFormId":"","storageDestination":"donations","order":14},{"cmd":"/donner","icon":"❓","title":"Offline Donation Update abcd","answer":"MMP Offline Donation Collection form","enabled":true,"adminOnly":true,"attachedFormId":"form_1786378063213","storageDestination":"donations","roleAccess":"donation_collector","id":"kb_1787890613067","attachedWhatsAppTplId":"","order":15},{"cmd":"/vibhag_edu","icon":"❓","title":"Vibhag wise education list update","answer":"abcd","enabled":true,"adminOnly":false,"attachedFormId":"","storageDestination":"donations","roleAccess":"public","attachedWhatsAppTplId":"tpl_1788285970128","targetEventIds":["all"],"connectedEventId":"ev_internal_1787674161506","connectedSubWorkspaceId":"doc_1788348538813","connectedSubWorkspaceName":"Education Committee > new vibhag","id":"kb_1788334344106","order":16}],"chatbotWelcomeText":"👋 **Namaste & Welcome!**\\n\\nI am your **Mumbai Meghwal panchayat Assistant**.\\n\\n• 🔍 **Check Application Status**: Type your **Transaction ID (e.g. VG-7, EDU26-2)** or registered **Mobile Num